is, ↓reduceIte, Ordering.swap_eq]\n    · rename_i h' h''\n      replace h' := (h y x).mpr ⟨h', Ne.symm h''⟩\n      simp only [h', ↓reduceIte, Ordering.swap_lt]","start":349,"end":363},"axioms":["propext"]}